#. (itstool) path: info/desc
#: C/feature-shell.page:5
msgid "Configure commands to run before and after backups"
msgstr ""
"Konfigurér kommandoer, som skal køre før og efter en sikkerhedskopiering"

#. (itstool) path: page/title
#: C/feature-shell.page:7
msgid "Shell Commands"
msgstr "Skalkommandoer"

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/feature-shell.page:8
msgid ""
"It is possible to run shell commands before and after backups. To configure "
"them, open <guiseq><gui>Menu</gui><gui>Backup Preferences</gui></guiseq>. "
"Use the start button to try out the command without running a backup."
msgstr ""
"Det er muligt at køre skalkommandoer før og efter sikkerhedskopiering. For "
"at konfigurere dem skal du åbne <guiseq><gui>Menu</gui><gui>Indstillinger "
"for sikkerhedskopiering</gui></guiseq>. Brug startknappen til at afprøve "
"kommandoen uden at foretage en sikkerhedskopiering."

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/feature-shell.page:9
msgid ""
"The <em>pre-backup</em> shell command will be executed right before starting "
"the backup. It can be used to perform database dumps, create file system "
"snapshots and much more."
msgstr ""
"Skalkommandoen <em>pre-backup</em> udføres, lige før sikkerhedskopieringen "
"starter. Den kan bruges til at udføre database-dumps, oprette "
"øjebliksbilleder af filsystemet og meget mere."

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/feature-shell.page:10
msgid ""
"The <em>post-backup</em> shell command is executed after the <cmd>borg "
"create</cmd> invocation, but before old archives are being deleted. This can "
"be used to tear down the actions done by the <em>pre-backup</em> command, or "
"run actions like sending a notification based on the outcome of the backup."
msgstr ""
"Skalkommandoen <em>post-backup</em> udføres efter aktiveringen af <cmd>borg "
"create</cmd>, men før gamle arkiver slettes. Dette kan bruges til at rydde "
"op efter de handlinger, der udføres af kommandoen <em>pre-backup</em>, eller "
"køre handlinger som at sende en meddelelse baseret på resultatet af "
"sikkerhedskopieringen."

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/feature-shell.page:11
msgid ""
"Both commands are being executed through a <cmd>bash</cmd> shell and have "
"context about the backup available as environment variables. The working "
"directory is the user home directory. The <em>post-backup</em> command also "
"has information about the success or failure of the backup and includes "
"backup statistics. See the tooltip in preferences for available environment "
"variables."
msgstr ""
"Begge kommandoer udføres gennem en <cmd>bash</cmd>-skal og har "
"kontekstinformation om sikkerhedskopien tilgængelig som miljøvariabler. "
"Arbejdsmappen er brugerens hjemmemappe. Kommandoen <em>post-backup</em> "
"indeholder også oplysninger om hvorvidt sikkerhedskopieringen blev fuldført "
"eller ej og indeholder relevant statistik. Se værktøjstippet i "
"indstillingerne for tilgængelige miljøvariabler."

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/feature-shell.page:12
msgid ""
"Exiting with a non-zero exit code will abort any further backup operations "
"with an error. The standard error output will be visible in the <gui>Backup "
"Info</gui> window on the <gui>Backup</gui> tab."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du afslutter med en slutkode, der ikke er nul, afbrydes alle yderligere "
"sikkerhedskopieringshandlinger med en fejl. Standardfejloutputtet vil være "
"synligt i vinduet <gui>Information om sikkerhedskopi</gui> i fanebladet "
"<gui>Sikkerhedskopiering</gui>."

#. (itstool) path: note/p
#: C/feature-shell.page:14
msgid ""
"You can run multiple commands by separating them with a <code>;</code> "
"character. It is recommended to store more complex scripts in a separate "
"file, for example in the home directory."
msgstr ""
"Du kan afvikle flere kommandoer ved at adskille dem med tegnet <code>;</"
"code>. Det anbefales at gemme mere komplekse scripts i en separat fil for "
"eksempel i hjemmemappen."

#. (itstool) path: info/desc
#: C/feature-schedule.page:5
msgid "Run backups automatically on a schedule"
msgstr "Udfør automatisk sikkerhedskopiering med fast interval"

#. (itstool) path: page/title
#: C/feature-schedule.page:7
msgid "Scheduled Backups"
msgstr "Planlagte sikkerhedskopieringer"

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/feature-schedule.page:8
msgid ""
"The schedule tab is used to configure the automatic creation of backups."
msgstr ""
"Fanebladet Planlægning bruges til at konfigurere den automatiske oprettelse "
"af sikkerhedskopier."

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/feature-schedule.page:9
msgid ""
"Once enabled a schedule can be chosen between <em>Hourly</em>, <em>Daily</"
"em>, <em>Weekly</em> and <em>Monthly</em> backups. The status display at the "
"top will always indicate the next time a backup is scheduled to be run."
msgstr ""
"Der kan vælges mellem <em>hver time</em>, <em>dagligt</em>, <em>ugentligt</"
"em> og <em>månedligt</em>. Statusvisningen øverst angiver altid hvornår, "
"næste gang en sikkerhedskopiering er planlagt til at blive kørt."

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/feature-schedule.page:10
msgid ""
"When the appropriate time has elapsed a backup will automatically start in "
"the background. When using an external drive, you will be prompted to insert "
"it if it's not available at the time. The backup will then start as soon as "
"the drive is connected."
msgstr ""
"Når den passende tid er gået, starter en sikkerhedskopiering automatisk i "
"baggrunden. Når du bruger et eksternt drev, bliver du bedt om at indsætte "
"det, hvis det ikke er tilgængeligt på det tidspunkt. Sikkerhedskopieringen "
"starter derefter, så snart drevet er tilsluttet."

#. (itstool) path: note/p
#: C/feature-schedule.page:12
msgid ""
"Scheduled backups use a lightweight background process called the "
"<em>Monitor</em>. The <em>Monitor</em> process runs in the background when "
"<app>Pika Backup</app> is closed and regularly checks if the conditions are "
"met to start a backup."
msgstr ""
"Planlagte sikkerhedskopieringer bruger en letvægtsproces i baggrunden kaldet "
"<em>Overvågning</em>. <em>Overvågnings</em>processen kører i baggrunden, når "
"<app>Pika Backup</app> er lukket, og kontrollerer regelmæssigt, om "
"betingelserne for at starte en sikkerhedskopiering er opfyldt."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: C/feature-schedule.page:15
msgid "Cleanup old Archives"
msgstr "Ryd op i gamle arkiver"

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/feature-schedule.page:16
msgid ""
"The schedule can also be configured to automatically remove old archives. "
"Once enabled, choose the desired preset / customize the amount of backups "
"that should be kept. Then press <gui type=\"button\">Save Configuration</"
"gui>."
msgstr ""
"Tidsplanen kan også konfigureres til automatisk at fjerne gamle arkiver. Når "
"den er aktiveret, skal du vælge den ønskede forudindstilling/tilpasse "
"mængden af sikkerhedskopier, der skal opbevares. Tryk derefter på <gui "
"type=\"button\">Gem konfiguration</gui>."

#. (itstool) path: note/p
#: C/feature-schedule.page:18
msgid ""
"<gui>Keep Hourly</gui>, <gui>Keep Daily</gui> and <gui>Keep Weekly</gui> can "
"only be configured to a minimum of at least <em>one</em> backup. This is due "
"to a technical limitation of the removal algorithm."
msgstr ""
"<gui>Behold hver time</gui>, <gui>Behold daglig</gui> og <gui>Behold "
"ugentlig</gui> kan kun konfigureres til et minimum af mindst <em>én</em> "
"sikkerhedskopi. Dette skyldes en teknisk begrænsning i fjernelsesalgoritmen."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: C/feature-schedule.page:22
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Fejlsøgning"

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/feature-schedule.page:23
msgid ""
"<app>Pika Backup</app> uses the <app>xdg-desktop-portal</app> "
"<app>Background Portal</app> to configure the <em>Monitor</em> process to "
"run in the background. Some distributions misconfigure <app>xdg-desktop-"
"portal</app> or don't enable the <em>Background Portal</em>. This will then "
"cause an error when enabling scheduled backups. We have tested the following "
"distributions for correct behavior regarding background portals in their "
"stock configuration:"
msgstr ""
"<app>Pika Backup</app> bruger <app>xdg-desktop-portal</app> <app>Background "
"Portal</app> til at konfigurere <em>overvågningsprocessen</em> til at køre i "
"baggrunden. Nogle distributioner konfigurerer <app>xdg-desktop-portal</app> "
"forkert eller aktiverer ikke <em>Background Portal</em>. Dette vil derefter "
"forårsage en fejl, når du aktiverer planlagte sikkerhedskopieringer. Vi har "
"testet følgende distributioner for korrekt adfærd vedrørende "
"baggrundsportaler i deres lagerkonfiguration:"

#. (itstool) path: item/p
#: C/feature-schedule.page:26
msgid "Debian"
msgstr "Debian"

#. (itstool) path: item/p
#: C/feature-schedule.page:29
msgid "Fedora"
msgstr "Fedora"

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/feature-schedule.page:32
msgid ""
"If you encounter issues with enabling scheduled backups and you are using a "
"different distribution, please report an issue in your distribution issue "
"tracker."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du støder på problemer med at aktivere planlagte sikkerhedskopieringer, "
"og du bruger en anden distribution, skal du rapportere et problem i din "
"distributions problemsporing."

#. (itstool) path: note/p
#: C/feature-schedule.page:34
msgid ""
"<app>GNOME Shell</app> will display <app>Pika Backup</app> as a running "
"background app whenever scheduled backups are configured. This doesn't mean "
"the entire app is running in the background but only the <em>Monitor</em> "
"process which only uses very few resources."
msgstr ""
"<app>GNOME Shell</app> vil vise <app>Pika Backup</app> som et kørende "
"baggrundsprogram, når planlagte sikkerhedskopieringer er konfigureret. Det "
"betyder ikke, at hele programmet kører i baggrunden, men kun "
"<em>overvågnings</em>processen, som kun bruger meget få ressourcer."

#. (itstool) path: info/desc
#: C/general-glossary.page:5
msgid "Definition of terms"
msgstr "Begrebsdefinitioner"

#. (itstool) path: page/title
#: C/general-glossary.page:7
msgid "Terminology"
msgstr "Terminologi"

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/general-glossary.page:8
msgid "These terms are commonly used in this documentation and within the app."
msgstr "Disse udtryk bruges ofte i denne dokumentation og i programmet."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: C/general-glossary.page:10
msgid "BorgBackup"
msgstr "BorgBackup"

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/general-glossary.page:11
msgid ""
"<app>BorgBackup</app> is the underlying program that is used to create "
"backups. <app>Pika Backup</app> repositories can also be accessed with the "
"BorgBackup commandline utility. See <link href=\"https://borgbackup."
"readthedocs.io\">BorgBackup documentation</link> for more information about "
"how to use the <cmd>borg</cmd> command line utility."
msgstr ""
"<app>BorgBackup</app> er det bagvedliggende program, der bruges til at "
"oprette sikkerhedskopier. Der kan også opnås adgang til <app>Pika Backup</"
"app>-opbevaringssteder via kommandolinjeværktøjet BorgBackup. Se <link "
"href=\"https://borgbackup.readthedocs.io\">BorgBackup-dokumentationen</link> "
"for yderligere oplysninger om, hvordan man bruger kommandolinjeværktøjet "
"<cmd>borg</cmd>."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: C/general-glossary.page:14
msgid "Repository"
msgstr "Opbevaringssted"

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/general-glossary.page:15
msgid ""
"Backup repositories are directories on a disk or on a remote location that "
"contain backup data. They store one or more <link "
"xref=\"#archive\">archives</link>."
msgstr ""
"Opbevaringssteder til sikkerhedskopier er mapper på en disk eller på en "
"fjernplacering, der indeholder sikkerhedskopidata. De lagrer et eller flere "
"<link xref=\"#archive\">arkiver</link>."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: C/general-glossary.page:18
msgid "Archive"
msgstr "Arkiv"

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/general-glossary.page:19
msgid ""
"Every backup will create one archive. They store a singular snapshot of the "
"files at the time the backup was created. To restore data from a particular "
"archive, see <link xref=\"index#recovery\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Hver sikkerhedskopi opretter et arkiv. De gemmer et enkelt øjebliksbillede "
"af filerne på det tidspunkt, hvor sikkerhedskopien blev oprettet. Hvis du "
"vil gendanne data fra et bestemt arkiv, skal du se <link "
"xref=\"index#recovery\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: C/general-glossary.page:22
msgid "Deduplication"
msgstr "Deduplikering"

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/general-glossary.page:23
msgid ""
"<app>Pika Backup</app> stores backup <link xref=\"#archive\">archives</link> "
"in a way that only new and changed data from the last backup use up more "
"disk space. The term <em>deduplication</em> is used to refer to this "
"functionality."
msgstr ""
"<app>Pika Backup</app> lagrer <link xref=\"#archive\">sikkerhedskopiarkiver</"
"link> på en måde, så kun nye og ændrede data fra den sidste sikkerhedskopi "
"bruger mere diskplads. Udtrykket <em>deduplikering</em> bruges til at "
"henvise til denne funktionalitet."

#. (itstool) path: note/p
#: C/general-glossary.page:25
msgid ""
"The amount of new space used for the last backup can be seen in the "
"<gui>Backup Info</gui> window that can be accessed via the <gui "
"style=\"tab\">Backup</gui> tab."
msgstr ""
"Mængden af ny plads, der blev brugt til den sidste sikkerhedskopiering, kan "
"ses i vinduet <gui>Information om sikkerhedskopi</gui>, som kan tilgås via "
"fanebladet <gui style=\"tab\">Sikkerhedskopi</gui>."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: C/general-glossary.page:29
msgid "Compression"
msgstr "Komprimering"

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/general-glossary.page:30
msgid ""
"Backup <link xref=\"#archive\">archives</link> created with <app>Pika "
"Backup</app> are compressed with the <em>zstd</em> algorithm on <em>level 3</"
"em>. This was chosen as a compromise between performance and resulting "
"backup size."
msgstr ""
"<link xref=\"#archive\">Sikkerhedskopiarkiver</link> oprettet med <app>Pika "
"Backup</app> komprimeres med <em>zstd</em>-algoritmen på <em>niveau 3</em>. "
"Dette blev valgt som et kompromis mellem ydeevne og resulterende størrelse "
"på sikkerhedskopien."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: C/general-glossary.page:33
msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "Kryptering"

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/general-glossary.page:34
msgid ""
"Backup repositories created with <app>Pika Backup</app> can be encrypted. "
"This will make it impossible for anyone to read the contents of the backup "
"without knowing or guessing the encryption <em>password</em>."
msgstr ""
"Opbevaringssteder til sikkerhedskopier, der er oprettet med <app>Pika "
"Backup</app>, kan krypteres. Dette vil gøre det umuligt for nogen at læse "
"indholdet af sikkerhedskopien uden at kende eller gætte "
"<em>krypteringsadgangskoden</em>."

#. (itstool) path: note/p
#: C/general-glossary.page:36
msgid ""
"While it is important to choose a strong encryption password for sensitive "
"data, losing the password also means losing access to all data. It is "
"equally important to choose a password that is not easily forgotten or "
"stored in a safe place."
msgstr ""
"Selvom det er vigtigt at vælge en stærk krypteringsadgangskode til følsomme "
"data, betyder det at miste adgangskoden også, at du mister adgangen til alle "
"data. Det er lige så vigtigt at vælge en adgangskode, der ikke let glemmes "
"eller opbevares et sikkert sted."

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/general-glossary.page:38
msgid ""
"The encryption algorithm used for new <link "
"type=\"repository\">repositories</link> is <em>AES-CTR-256</em>. The "
"authentication algorithm is either <em>HMAC-SHA256</em> or <em>BLAKE2b-256</"
"em> depending on whether SHA256 is hardware-accelerated on the system."
msgstr ""
"Krypteringsalgoritmen, der bruges til nye <link "
"type=\"repository\">opbevaringssteder</link>, er <em>AES-CTR-256</em>. "
"Godkendelsesalgoritmen er enten <em>HMAC-SHA256</em> eller <em>BLAKE2b-256</"
"em> afhængigt af, om SHA256 er hardwareaccelereret på systemet."

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/general-glossary.page:39
msgid ""
"The encryption password can be changed via <guiseq><gui>Menu</"
"gui><gui>Backup Preferences</gui><gui>Change Encryption Password</gui></"
"guiseq>."
msgstr ""
"Krypteringsadgangskoden kan ændres via <guiseq><gui>Menu</"
"gui><gui>Indstillinger for sikkerhedskopiering</gui><gui>Ændr adgangskode "
"til kryptering</gui></guiseq>."

